    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The first rule of Anal Club</strong> is that no one talks about Anal Club.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The second rule of Anal Club</strong> is that no one talks about Anal Club. We insist. Unless you're telling a girl who enjoys anal sex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The third rule of Anal Club</strong> is that there must be no more than one guy in the room. The number of women doesn't matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fourth rule of Anal Club</strong> is that sex ends when you've fucked a girl's ass and come inside it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fifth rule of Anal Club</strong> is that you can't leave if you've only fucked one ass that night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sixth rule of Anal Club</strong> is that erotic clothing is allowed in the rooms, but nothing that covers the parts we all want to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The seventh rule of Anal Club</strong> is that each sexual encounter ends when all participants want it to. Only then will the room's door open, and you can leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And the eighth and final rule of Anal Club</strong> is that if it's your first night at Anal Club, you have to fuck three asses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774560/extras/768d9039a0b1f6a6a0d0c0ddde6efb87.avif?t=1753701026\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sayuri, pure elegance</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss and manager. Good friend. Dominant. Ass lover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774560/extras/67c6a5a4c536468d38258a22f1ad5189.avif?t=1753701026\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaori, the innocent one</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to Anal Club. Shy and insecure. Eager to please. Easily falls in love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774560/extras/995af15ff50c82fbea4bad63e9161ad5.avif?t=1753701026\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emi, the sweet one</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feels like she's known you forever. Submissive. Totally submissive. Likes being punished. Enjoys a spanking now and then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774560/extras/bd529d316285875b37b5945c4fb0a436.avif?t=1753701026\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haruka, the most energetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Founding member of Anal Club. Always smiling. Always in the mood. Always makes you laugh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774560/extras/d4004fd812c0490fd38108e28935def6.avif?t=1753701026\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mei, the tender one</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Founding member of Anal Club. Cheerful, submissive, and kind, but also a beast in bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774560/extras/544916e8ea7b13df92139f9d1218dc3d.avif?t=1753701026\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miyu, the mysterious one</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little is known about Miyu. She doesn't talk much, and it's hard to spot her around the club. She's someone who makes you wait and desire, wait and desire\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel++ Format:</strong> Each girl has different story arcs that complete her own narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Censorship!</strong>: We've removed censorship from the images (we\u2019ll add an option later to censor them as preferred).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gallery:</strong> Fill an image album as you progress through the story and revisit the chapters you've completed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose the Girl:</strong> Decide which girl to pursue as the story unfolds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flashback:</strong> Go back in the story at any time to change a decision or relive a moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth Navigation:</strong> Choose whether text progresses automatically or skip it to reach your favorite part.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audio:</strong> Including music, sound effects, voices, and &quot;other effects.&quot; Adjust volume settings independently or mute everything.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters depicted and visually represented in this game are over 18 years old, and no real or identifiable minors were used in the production of this game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Help us out!</strong> If you think you can improve the narrative in your language, feel free to send us your suggestions via email or message us on our Steam page.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We're still working on it:</strong> All updates and improvements we develop will be added to the game at no additional cost.</p></li></ul>",
